 Environmental conditions (weather, lightning, zero gravity)<br></li><li> Hundreds of teams ready to show their battle strategies<br></li><li> Various weapons for the contestants<br></li><li> And pretty much anything that can make a typical arena confrontation more fun</li></ul>",
